  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): カミヤツデ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AB%E3%83%9F%E3%83%A4%E3%83%84%E3%83%87",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 106353289,
      "text": "カミヤツデ とはウコギ科の常緑低木。別名、ツウソウ（通草）、 ツウダツボク（通脱木）。カミヤツデ属唯一の現生種である。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Tetrapanax",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tetrapanax",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1354642362,
      "text": "Tetrapanax papyrifer, the rice paper plant, is an evergreen shrub or small tree in the family Araliaceae, the sole species in the genus Tetrapanax. The specific epithet is frequently misspelled as \"papyriferum\", \"papyriferus\", or \"papyrifera\". It is native to eastern and central China and Taiwan, but widely cultivated in East Asia and in other tropical to mild temperate regions as well."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Tetrapanax papyrifer",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tetrapanax_papyrifer",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 174152689,
      "text": "Tetrapanax papyrifer es un arbusto perenne perteneciente a la familia Araliaceae, la única especie del género es Tetrapanax. Es endémico de Taiwán, pero también es cultivado ampliamente en el este de Asia."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Tetrapanax papyrifer",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tetrapanax_papyrifer",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 234341230,
      "text": "Tetrapanax papyrifer, l'Arbre à papier de riz ou Aralie à papier de Chine est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Araliaceae. C'est un arbuste originaire de Chine méridionale et de l'île de Taïwan."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Tetrapanax papyrifer",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tetrapanax_papyrifer",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 40212543,
      "text": "Tetrapanax papyrifer é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família Araliaceae."
    }
  },
